00:26:09,600 --> 00:26:11,760
Give me the phone back.

267
00:26:11,840 --> 00:26:13,040
Next...

268
00:26:13,840 --> 00:26:15,040
it's couple photo time.

269
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,320
Get a little closer.

270
00:26:19,560 --> 00:26:21,440
Come on, that's not romantic at all.

271
00:26:21,520 --> 00:26:23,040
Do something romantic.

272
00:26:23,600 --> 00:26:24,680
Yeah, like that.

273
00:26:27,800 --> 00:26:30,320
We can't finish it. Let's get Mom to help.

274
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,560
Sure.

275
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:38,600
TULYA LAWYER: SENT PICTURE

276
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:44,800
TULYA LAWYER: SENT PICTURE

277
00:26:44,880 --> 00:26:46,880
TULYA LAWYER: SENT PICTURE

278
00:27:06,880 --> 00:27:13,280
TULYA LAWYER: THANKS, THIS HOTEL LOOKS NICE

279
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:31,600
Why did you do that?

280
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:33,640
I thought I'd take a chance.

281
00:27:33,720 --> 00:27:35,840
If Chris was with that woman that night,

282
00:27:35,920 --> 00:27:38,720
and she really is SteveJob123,

283
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:40,760
I figured she'd follow us.

284
00:27:41,840 --> 00:27:44,920
You were just adding fuel to the fire.

285
00:27:46,200 --> 00:27:48,760
I was luring a moth to a flame.

286
00:27:49,440 --> 00:27:52,120
Or you could end up getting burned.

287
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:55,080
PORNHOVA HOSPITAL

288
00:29:00,320 --> 00:29:06,560
WHEN PEOPLE ARE BIG AND GOD IS SMALL

289
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:08,680
I drove all the way
to Radiant Book Centre for this.

290
00:29:09,280 --> 00:29:11,720
It was on the new arrivals shelf.

291
00:29:12,200 --> 00:29:14,080
I thought you might not have it yet.

292
00:29:17,120 --> 00:29:18,360
Thanks, Tul.

293
00:29:20,800 --> 00:29:22,480
I hope you like it.

294
00:29:33,760 --> 00:29:36,800
Chris, I may have gone too far
with your mother.

295
00:29:36,880 --> 00:29:39,920
But I just wanted to warn her
not to abuse her power.

296
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:43,320
I never meant to get her sent to jail.

297
00:29:44,120 --> 00:29:46,440
I put you in the middle,

298
00:29:46,520 --> 00:29:48,520
leaving you caught between us.

299
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:50,440
I'm sorry.

300
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:53,000
Love, Tul.

301
00:30:23,640 --> 00:30:25,400
Please help me...

302
00:30:27,440 --> 00:30:29,560
break free from these sinful thoughts.

303
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:33,160
I feel angry

304
00:30:35,160 --> 00:30:37,120
and hate myself more than anything.

305
00:30:39,480 --> 00:30:41,200
Please guide me

306
00:30:43,280 --> 00:30:46,120
and free me from this suffering.

307
00:30:56,960 --> 00:31:00,920
HELL HOME INBOX

308
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:15,520
DON'T FALL IN LOVE WITH HIM
GET YOUR REVENGE

309
00:31:45,000 --> 00:31:46,840
- Whoa, Nalin.
- Chris

310
00:31:47,160 --> 00:31:49,200
I need to talk to you.

311
00:31:50,040 --> 00:31:51,520
I have nothing to say to you.

312
00:31:51,600 --> 00:31:54,360
- Don't come looking for me again.
- Chris, I have something to confess.

313
00:31:55,920 --> 00:31:58,840
Chris, I brought your cross back.

314
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:03,160
Keep it.

315
00:32:04,840 --> 00:32:07,040
May God guide you toward the light.

316
00:32:08,280 --> 00:32:09,520
Chris, Chris!

317
00:32:09,600 --> 00:32:11,360
We need to talk. Chris!

318
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:13,160
Just give me a minute.

319
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:14,320
Chris?

320
00:32:14,400 --> 00:32:15,240
Chris!

321
00:32:15,320 --> 00:32:16,520
Chris!

322
00:32:16,600 --> 00:32:17,880
Chris!

323
00:32:17,960 --> 00:32:18,960
Chris...

324
00:33:31,560 --> 00:33:32,760
Chris...

325
00:33:34,200 --> 00:33:35,480
I'm sorry.

326
00:33:39,160 --> 00:33:41,200
That night shouldn't have happened.

327
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:46,800
It was my fault.

328
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:48,680
Not yours. Not at all.

329
00:33:52,360 --> 00:33:54,960
Then try praying to God

330
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:58,480
and ask Him for forgiveness.

331
00:34:00,760 --> 00:34:02,520
Because I'm doing the same thing.

332
00:34:11,560 --> 00:34:12,760
You know...

333
00:34:13,960 --> 00:34:15,840
ever since I saw that painting,

334
00:34:16,640 --> 00:34:18,960
The Family Closest to God's Hand...

335
00:34:22,280 --> 00:34:26,040
I never felt like my
hand was close to God's.

336
00:34:30,120 --> 00:34:32,000
Instead, I felt...

337
00:34:33,840 --> 00:34:35,720
He was always out of reach.

338
00:34:39,880 --> 00:34:41,960
So many hands tightly hold onto one hand,

339
00:34:42,840 --> 00:34:44,680
holding that person back.

340
00:34:48,520 --> 00:34:50,240
The more you love someone,

341
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:52,480
the more it traps you

342
00:34:53,920 --> 00:34:55,040
and holds you back

343
00:34:57,440 --> 00:34:59,480
until you can't even see
your own happiness anymore.

344
00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:05,560
Because you're too busy
trying to make everyone else happy.

345
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:16,560
You taught me what it means to feel warmth.

346
00:35:20,480 --> 00:35:22,160
I've never known that feeling.

347
00:35:26,240 --> 00:35:28,120
Can you forgive me?

348
00:35:33,320 --> 00:35:34,320
Chris?

349
00:35:47,120 --> 00:35:48,800
If it will give you peace...

350
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:52,200
I forgive you.

351
00:35:57,640 --> 00:35:58,680
Then could you...

352
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:01,960
look me in the eyes

353
00:36:03,240 --> 00:36:04,760
and say it again?

354
00:36:10,440 --> 00:36:11,600
Chris?

355
00:36:41,840 --> 00:36:43,320
For I am the Lord your God

356
00:36:45,920 --> 00:36:47,800
who takes hold of your right hand

357
00:36:48,520 --> 00:36:50,080
nd says to you,

358
00:36:50,600 --> 00:36:51,880
"Do not fear;

359
00:36:59,040 --> 00:37:00,360
I will help you."

360
00:37:03,080 --> 00:37:04,080
Amen.

361
00:37:15,440 --> 00:37:17,480
Chris, can you come pick me up?

362
00:37:51,120 --> 00:37:52,240
Whose is this?

363
00:37:59,840 --> 00:38:01,400
Stay away from that bitch.

364
00:38:01,880 --> 00:38:04,000
Look at this. She's really something.

365
00:38:19,800 --> 00:38:21,600
STEVEJOB123 SENT A PICTURE

366
00:40:03,280 --> 00:40:04,320
Mother.

367
00:40:07,240 --> 00:40:08,240
What's this about?

368
00:40:08,520 --> 00:40:10,000
Why didn't you knock?

369
00:40:12,680 --> 00:40:13,720
What's this?

370
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:21,360
Come on. It's obvious.

371
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:22,960
Why are you asking me?

372
00:40:23,560 --> 00:40:26,560
Are you testing me for Alzheimer's?

373
00:40:28,200 --> 00:40:29,920
Thanks for worrying, though.

374
00:40:32,400 --> 00:40:34,320
I saw you throw it away in the trash.

375
00:40:36,040 --> 00:40:38,240
I would never use cheap garbage like that.

376
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:42,960
Now you just admitted it isn't yours.

377
00:40:43,560 --> 00:40:45,120
So where did you get it?

378
00:40:46,240 --> 00:40:48,400
Someone at church probably handed it to me.

379
00:40:48,480 --> 00:40:50,400
I couldn't just say no, could I?

380
00:40:53,520 --> 00:40:54,680
Someone at church?

381
00:40:55,480 --> 00:40:58,040
Was it SteveJob123?

382
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:05,720
What's the big deal
over one tube of lipstick?

383
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:08,480
Then look at this.

384
00:41:10,240 --> 00:41:12,400
She sent me this photo just to gloat.

385
00:41:12,880 --> 00:41:15,960
She's practically announcing herself to me,
yet you're still covering for her.

386
00:41:17,880 --> 00:41:20,200
You know Chris is seeing someone else,
don't you?

387
00:41:20,760 --> 00:41:21,760
No idea.

388
00:41:21,840 --> 00:41:23,240
So there is someone.

389
00:41:23,320 --> 00:41:24,360
There isn't.

390
00:41:24,440 --> 00:41:25,280
Who is she, Mother?

391
00:41:25,360 --> 00:41:26,920
How could you do this?

392
00:41:27,000 --> 00:41:28,560
We're both women.

393
00:41:28,640 --> 00:41:30,080
Instead of understanding my pain,

394
00:41:30,160 --> 00:41:31,960
you're helping Chris
cover up his wrongdoing.

395
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:33,440
Don't be ridiculous.

396
00:41:33,520 --> 00:41:35,920
Then why are you walking away from this?

397
00:41:36,000 --> 00:41:38,120
Chris isn't having an affair. Satisfied?

398
00:41:38,200 --> 00:41:40,400
He would never do anything so immoral.

399
00:41:40,480 --> 00:41:43,040
You don't sound believable at all!

400
00:41:45,160 --> 00:41:46,296
Why are you still running away?

401
00:41:46,320 --> 00:41:48,000
Now you're keeping silent?

402
00:41:49,000 --> 00:41:51,280
You can't run from the truth forever.

403
00:41:53,600 --> 00:41:55,200
Who is this woman?

404
00:41:56,040 --> 00:41:57,920
Uh... what's going on here?

405
00:42:00,240 --> 00:42:01,560
If you won't answer,

406
00:42:01,840 --> 00:42:03,800
I'll ask Chris right now.

407
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:07,880
Chris, whose lipstick is this?

408
00:42:09,080 --> 00:42:10,480
Why does this person even matter?

409
00:42:10,920 --> 00:42:13,760
Can you stop making a fuss
over every little thing?

410
00:42:13,840 --> 00:42:15,240
How can I not make a fuss?

411
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:16,880
This was found in Chris's car!

412
00:42:16,960 --> 00:42:18,600
And that woman messaged me

413
00:42:18,680 --> 00:42:20,400
saying she dropped it right there!

414
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:21,536
Then why didn't you just ask her?

415
00:42:21,560 --> 00:42:22,680
Because...

416
00:42:42,720 --> 00:42:45,600
Grandma, I brought a
friend over for dinner.

417
00:42:59,080 --> 00:43:01,240
Hello. My name is Nalin.

418
00:43:09,320 --> 00:43:11,800
I like warm and caring men.

419
00:43:11,880 --> 00:43:13,696
You can't get sued for divorce.
Absolutely not!

420
00:43:13,720 --> 00:43:16,136
It'll affect your chances
of becoming Church Council president.

421
00:43:16,160 --> 00:43:19,400
Don't let your religious fanaticism
blind you.

422
00:43:19,480 --> 00:43:22,240
Is it true that you’re having an affair,
Reverend Sattha?

423
00:43:23,240 --> 00:43:24,080
Are you serious?

424
00:43:24,160 --> 00:43:25,800
It didn't look like ordinary counseling.

425
00:43:25,880 --> 00:43:27,440
The two of them were hugging too.

426
00:43:27,520 --> 00:43:28,600
You put me in a tough spot.

427
00:43:28,640 --> 00:43:30,000
You're just a coward.

428
00:43:30,080 --> 00:43:31,800
I've said "Amen" a thousand times!

429
00:43:31,880 --> 00:43:33,320
And this is what I get?

430
00:43:33,400 --> 00:43:36,440
Even if I delete that video,
it still doesn't mean Chris is safe.
